[SIZE=6][B]MC Macro Mod - Release Notes[/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=5][B]Version 0.1.2-beta (Minecraft 26.3)[/B][/SIZE]

### Modular Free vs Premium Compilation Architecture
[LIST]
[*][B]Compile-Time Source Set Separation:[/B] Restructured codebase into decoupled Gradle source sets ([CODE]src/main[/CODE], [CODE]src/free[/CODE], and [CODE]src/premium[/CODE]). The Free edition contains zero paywalled classes or event loop bytecodes.
[*][B]Modrinth Terms of Service Compliance:[/B] Physically excluded proprietary feature classes ([CODE]ScriptInterpreter[/CODE], [CODE]PremiumEventTriggers[/CODE], [CODE]ScriptLibrary[/CODE], etc.) from the free JAR for Modrinth compliance.
[*][B]Modern PaperMC Adventure Component API:[/B] Refactored [CODE]MacroModServerPlugin.java[/CODE] to use Kyori Adventure Components ([CODE]Component[/CODE], [CODE]NamedTextColor[/CODE]) and [CODE]getPluginMeta()[/CODE], removing all deprecated Bukkit ChatColor references.
[*][B]Performance & Memory Optimizations:[/B] Optimized [CODE]InlineScriptInterpreter[/CODE] regex splitting using pre-compiled static patterns, improved execution flow with [CODE]Optional<Boolean>[/CODE], and eliminated unused imports/fields across all subprojects.
[/LIST]
